cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "AntHocNet for NS-3"
abstract: >-
  A simulator-agnostic C++ implementation of the AntHocNet ant-colony-optimization
  routing protocol for mobile ad hoc networks, with a thin adapter for the NS-3
  network simulator and a shared, testable algorithm core (releases through
  v1.9.0 also ship an NS-2 adapter).
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Joppi
    given-names: Daniel Henrique
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-6436-8174"
version: 2.6.1
date-released: "2026-10-29"
